<!--
  HAZARD glyph: the warning triangle with an exclamation mark.

  The triangle is the only glyph in the set with a hard apex, so it separates
  from the others on outline alone. Note the badge behind it carries the amber
  category colour: the mark is punched OUT of the triangle (evenOdd) so it shows
  the badge through, rather than being drawn amber-on-white — an amber sign on
  the light day basemap is exactly the low-contrast case this change fixes.
-->
